# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# The game lived at crossword.thexigames.com and now lives at
# thexigames.com/crossword/. Everything that was shared while it was there has
# to keep working — a dead shared link is a player who never comes back.
#
# THE SPLAT CARRIES THE QUERY STRING. Pages appends the original query to the
# destination automatically, and that is the whole point here: a shared result
# is /?token=practice:42 and a challenge invite is /?c=<id>. A redirect that
# dropped the query would send every one of them to a blank landing screen and
# nothing would look broken from the outside.
#
# 301 rather than 302: the old address should stop being the address. Search
# engines pass ranking on a 301 and browsers cache it, which is what we want
# now that the noindex is off the new home.

https://crossword.thexigames.com/*   https://www.thexigames.com/crossword/:splat   301
http://crossword.thexigames.com/*    https://www.thexigames.com/crossword/:splat   301

# The apex to www, so there is one canonical host and not two.
https://thexigames.com/*             https://www.thexigames.com/:splat             301
